        "mitigation": "The teacher review step before Accept; edit or regenerate doubtful tests."
      },
      {
        "limitation": "Timing-based complexity is an estimate",
        "example": "An O(n log n) sort and an O(n) loop can produce the same curve at n <= 32000 when input reading dominates, so both are reported as O(n).",
